{"title":"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Remarks_(added_by_pf02,_September_2024)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Remarks (added by pf02, September 2024)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve the system of equations\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/f/1bfc6c16fe54891fd84bb5e8b39af948cc6647e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ |a_1 - a_2| x_2 + |a_1 - a_3| x_3 + |a_1 - a_4| x_4 = 1 \\\\ |a_2 - a_1| x_1 + \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ |a_2 - a_3| x_3 + |a_2 - a_4| x_4 = 1 \\\\ |a_3 - a_1| x_1 + |a_3 - a_2| x_2 + \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ |a_3 - a_4| x_4 = 1 \\\\ |a_4 - a_1| x_1 + |a_4 - a_2| x_2 + |a_4 - a_3| x_3 \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"80\" />\n</p><p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/5/73571b015609a99f144d1eaa014bb986bc106628.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, a_3, a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"11\" /> are four different real numbers.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Take a1 &gt; a2 &gt; a3 &gt; a4. Subtracting the equation for i=2 from that for i=1 and dividing by (a1 - a2) we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f4090428c51248fedca0dad530bb6bcc9c43ac7a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[- x1 + x2 + x3 + x4 = 0.\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting the equation for i=4 from that for i=3 and dividing by (a3 - a4) we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/4/894aa6afa34cc8d124ed7818f5bb3767749ad0b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[- x1 - x2 - x3 + x4 = 0.\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Hence x1 = x4. Subtracting the equation for i=3 from that for i=2 and dividing by (a2 - a3) we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71e9abe49a9d910150c4163438842584a6ae8529.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[- x1 - x2 + x3 + x4 = 0.\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dacef8cf7dcaa441844d8a9a52c0957fa6d4207c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x2 = x3 = 0$\" width=\"96\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66f4037c2eaba2e0504c41c2d662cb444f968fbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x1 = x4 = 1/(a1 - a4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"177\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Remarks_.28added_by_pf02.2C_September_2024.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Remarks_(added_by_pf02,_September_2024)\">Remarks (added by pf02, September 2024)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Remarks (added by pf02, September 2024)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The solution above is in the realm of flawed and incorrect.\nIt is flawed because you can not claim to have solved a\nsystem of equations by having solved a particular case.\nIt is correct in solving the particular case, but it is\nincorrect in stating that the result obtained is a solution\nto the system in general.\n</p><p>Below I will give a complete solution to the problem.  The\nfirst few lines will be a repetition of the \"solution\" above,\nand I will repeat them for the sake of completeness and of a\nmore tidy writing.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are 24 possibilities when we count the ordering of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/5/73571b015609a99f144d1eaa014bb986bc106628.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, a_3, a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"11\" />, and each ordering gives a different\nsystem of equations.  Let us consider one of them, like\nin the \"solution\" above.\n</p><p>Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fba0de863e9decbb6d4a1cc4f32de5b1739952b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 &gt; a_2 &gt; a_3 &gt; a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" />.  In this case, the system is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583e0648fd7a762f1d4e617505aafc829238cdf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (a_1 - a_2) x_2 + (a_1 - a_3) x_3 + (a_1 - a_4) x_4 = 1 \\\\ (a_1 - a_2) x_1 + \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (a_2 - a_3) x_3 + (a_2 - a_4) x_4 = 1 \\\\ (a_1 - a_3) x_1 + (a_2 - a_3) x_2 + \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (a_3 - a_4) x_4 = 1 \\\\ (a_1 - a_4) x_1 + (a_2 - a_4) x_2 + (a_3 - a_4) x_3 \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"80\" />\n</p><p>Subtract the second equation from the first, and divide by\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/d/a3d8b78b72df0f92e3c1b99c8990fb2e3575962f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1 - a_2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" />.  Also, subtract the fourth equation from the\nthird, and divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fff3158da49433ccc4bb0b2ba9bd025ca6cc8b8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_3 - a_4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" />.  We obtain\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb22a9e8e5357bb0b84f9992a2b241e4368b8ccd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x_1 + x_2 + x_3 + x_4 = 0 \\\\ -x_1 - x_2 - x_3 + x_4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p>It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77d7b16caba6d3417ce609f9b494969537114520.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 - x_4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/3/c2397bc9d2472abcc663209d5f1c2d9a80fba97e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2 + x_3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Subtract the third equation from the second, and divide by\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/6/e26c2d34957b37a4a317dcc8dad99a00c0c54270.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_2 - a_3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" />.  We obtain\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/c/fcc833f69ec7d7ad74d24c27cf8ae5a436d71b9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x_1 - x_2 + x_3 + x_4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77d7b16caba6d3417ce609f9b494969537114520.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 - x_4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb2851c3aab70c2c72c218a8437ccf8a9207b97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2 - x_3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />.\nCombining with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/3/c2397bc9d2472abcc663209d5f1c2d9a80fba97e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2 + x_3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf28983ee415e35c6ca1dc8056250d31be0763bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2 = x_3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />.\nReplacing these in the first equation of the system, we\nget <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3f37738af504b07cd2d7d6884ee5399f24ef6dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4 = \\frac{1}{a_1 - a_4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"104\" height=\"41\" />, so we also have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541d207e54819cd964987afe1f26af38af370655.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 = \\frac{1}{a_1 - a_4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"104\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>Now we have two ways of proceeding.  We could consider each\nof the other 23 cases, and solve it by a similar method.\nThe task is made easy if we notice that each case is obtained\nfrom the first case by a permutation of indices, so it can be\nviewed as a change of notation.  With some care, we can just\nwrite the solution in each case.  For example, in the case\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa21020c266575415056e20ee7f30fe684e60bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 &gt; a_1 &gt; a_3 &gt; a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" />, we will obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/7/ce7bebc264422c344be641706b33da885544249a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 = x_3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />\nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/9/a590826b0c91b98e38db70ea7c688fdd0086c37e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2 = x_4 = \\frac{1}{a_2 - a_4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"146\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>We will proceed differently, but we will use the same idea.\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/5/a3534741c8990486b980f3309b06bd3966b76c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n, p, q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" /> be the indices such that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/f/46fed2bde92ead2ee0b408c367731c3d5d486ac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m &gt; a_n &gt; a_p &gt; a_q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"150\" height=\"17\" />.  Written in a compact way, our\nsystem becomes\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/0/650cf785b89b0c7320fef7e9e0e1a81794ec0dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{\\substack{i = 1 \\\\ i \\ne j}}^4 |a_j - a_i| x_i = 1, \\ \\ \\ \\ j = 1, 2, 3, 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -35px\" width=\"267\" height=\"67\" />.\n</p><p>Make the following change of notation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08bb496d7251cc6263e910a304559ab4554efba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m \\rightarrow b_1 \\\\ a_n \\rightarrow b_2 \\\\ a_p \\rightarrow b_3 \\\\ a_q \\rightarrow b_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"79\" />\n</p><p>and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/8/f28cac72db3f5488120987b828ed9b2b45506704.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_m \\rightarrow y_1 \\\\ x_n \\rightarrow y_2 \\\\ x_p \\rightarrow y_3 \\\\ x_q \\rightarrow y_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"74\" />\n</p><p>In the new notation we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/b/9cb71537f2190bb59c0d3a34e89c6707a20b0434.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1 &gt; b_2 &gt; b_3 &gt; b_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"17\" /> and\nthe system becomes\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/4164109d931147e269c80eef99ea09d3ccf9e02d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{\\substack{k = 1 \\\\ k \\ne l}}^4 |b_l - b_k| y_k = 1, \\ \\ \\ \\ l = 1, 2, 3, 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -35px\" width=\"263\" height=\"68\" />.\n</p><p>This is exactly the system we solved above, just with a\nnew notation (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/199cde877876a3d160dba8dc4e80976e0455a076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> instead of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f2baf8545a1e9ac16637c704af7a098d5bc6dcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" />).  So the solutions\nare <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/3/4f394b2d28137403057206a770394a0fba56c2ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_2 = y_3 = 0, y_1 = y_4 = \\frac{1}{b_1 - b_4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"238\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>Returning to our original notation, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/f/42fb040f6f51a1134e615541c6e8c8d929c91186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n = x_p = 0, x_m, x_q = \\frac{1}{a_m - a_q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"243\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>In conclusion, here is a compact way of giving the solution\nto the system:  let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be the index of the largest of the\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />'s, and q = the index of the smallest of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />'s,\nand let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d3d0b3d7cd476f15b8becadd07d8e5979cd560e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n, p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" /> be the other two indices.  Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/f/42fb040f6f51a1134e615541c6e8c8d929c91186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n = x_p = 0, x_m, x_q = \\frac{1}{a_m - a_q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"243\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>[Solution by pf02, September 2024]\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO\" title=\"1966 IMO\">1966 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017043730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.113 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 251/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8919/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.996      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.996      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9825:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017043730 and revision id 233119. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}